    {"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"triggerAtHour":7}]}},"id":"ab36d6be-25b5-4ae9-b071-8527739e7de9","name":"Owner Digest 7AM","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[-1184,1504]},
    {"parameters":{"operation":"get","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"ortho_events"},"returnAll":true},"id":"502d4abe-41c2-40da-aec4-7fcda02784f9","name":"Get Recent Events","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[-960,1504],"alwaysOutputData":true},
    {"parameters":{"jsCode":"const cutoff = new Date(Date.now() - 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString();\nconst events = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(e => e.event && e.at && e.at >= cutoff);\nconst count = k => events.filter(e => e.event === k).length;\nconst missed = count(\"missed_call\");\nconst textedBack = count(\"sms_sent\") + count(\"sms_simulated\");\nconst booked = count(\"booking_confirmed\");\nconst queued = count(\"queued_for_callback\") + count(\"cold_inbound\") + count(\"inbound_logged\");\nconst optOuts = count(\"opt_out\");\nconst rows = [\n  [\"Missed calls caught\", missed],\n  [\"Text-backs + replies sent\", textedBack],\n  [\"Consults booked by text\", booked],\n  [\"Handed to front desk\", queued],\n  [\"Opt-outs\", optOuts]\n].map(r => \"<tr><td style=\\\"padding:6px 14px 6px 0\\\">\" + r[0] + \"</td><td style=\\\"padding:6px 0;font-weight:bold\\\">\" + r[1] + \"</td></tr>\").join(\"\");\nconst html = \"<div style=\\\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a2332\\\">\" +\n  \"<h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 4px\\\">Practice digest - last 24 hours</h2>\" +\n  \"<p style=\\\"margin:0 0 14px;color:#5d6b80\\\">Missed-call recovery mock. Every number below is traceable in ortho_events.</p>\" +\n  \"<table style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse\\\">\" + rows + \"</table>\" +\n  \"<p style=\\\"margin:14px 0 0;color:#5d6b80\\\">\" + (booked > 0 ? \"Every booking here started as a call nobody answered.\" : \"No bookings in this window - queue and templates are ready.\") + \"</p></div>\";\nreturn [{ json: {\n  subject: \"Practice digest - \" + missed + \" missed calls caught, \" + booked + \" consults booked\",\n  html\n} }];"},"id":"78e69784-9173-4756-81bb-0285ac1bbcdf","name":"Build Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-736,1504]},
    {"parameters":{"sendTo":"owner@example.com","subject":"={{ $json.subject }}","message":"={{ $json.html }}","options":{"appendAttribution":false,"senderName":"Practice Automation OS"},"resource":"message","operation":"send"},"id":"6f347265-606f-4fcb-87a8-c736c86248b6","name":"Send Owner Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[-528,1504]},
    {"parameters":{"dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"ortho_events"},"columns":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{"event":"digest_sent","phone":"","detail":"={{ $('Build Digest').item.json.subject }}","at":"={{ $now.toISO() }}"},"schema":[{"id":"event","displayName":"event","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"phone","displayName":"phone","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"detail","displayName":"detail","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"at","displayName":"at","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"type":"string","canBeUsedToMatch":true}]},"options":{}},"id":"4c43b025-ff18-43c7-95d6-30cf4869982f","name":"Log Digest Sent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[-304,1504]},
    {"parameters":{"content":"# Practice Front-Office Agent (demo)\n\nDe-branded vertical product template with fictional demo data. **Swap map for a real deployment:**\n- Missed Call Webhook <- phone system missed-call event subscription\n- Inbound SMS Webhook <- phone system / SMS provider inbound hook\n- ortho_slots + booking <- PMS API (open-slot query + appointment write)\n- Twilio sender <- the practice's own number\n\nSynthetic data only. No PHI. State machine: texted -> offered -> booked / queued / opted_out.","height":220,"width":520,"color":4},"id":"5e235535-fd81-4525-91d7-f6e995b03f0e","name":"Sticky Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-1184,-528]},
    {"parameters":{"content":"## Send gate\nEvery outbound SMS passes this IF. Ships in **simulate** mode: messages log as sms_simulated, nothing sends.\n\nTo go live: change the left value from `simulate` to `live` and set the Twilio From number.\n\nTemplates only - anything templates can't answer routes to the human queue by design.","height":400,"width":540,"color":3},"id":"f3005353-16ef-449b-9459-3362d222ee79","name":"Sticky Send Gate","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-48,-656]},
    {"parameters":{"content":"## Reply triage\nAny OpenAI-compatible model (local via LM Studio, or a BAA-covered cloud model in production). If the model is down or unsure, error/other outputs route to Queue for Callback - a human always catches what AI drops. STOP is handled rule-based BEFORE any AI sees the text.","height":200,"width":300,"color":5},"id":"17c7f1b3-8182-449f-b669-2a74df4ed8d8","name":"Sticky Triage","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-416,176]},
    {"parameters":{"content":"## Owner digest\nDaily 7:00 summary of the last 24h of events, emailed to the owner. No dashboards, no logins.","height":200,"width":740,"color":6},"id":"c97b48ee-9c26-4917-9909-15fd5853f192","name":"Sticky Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-1904,368]},
    {"parameters":{"content":"## Admin section - the owner's SMS command line\nSender phone is checked against ortho_admins. Admins get two powers:\n1) **Relay**: `text +1555...: message` sends to that patient (through the send gate).\n2) **Ask anything**: full practice state (facts, queue, conversations, events, slots) is assembled and answered by the model, SMS-length, with per-admin memory.\n\nReplace the seeded demo admin number with the real owner's cell. Production hardening: role-based admin powers + PIN step-up. Everything an admin does is logged.","height":240,"width":460,"color":2},"id":"f63e9682-6482-4e95-b7bc-c92bb27df224","name":"Sticky Admin","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-1488,1136]}
  ],
